"- Ellen and Mika have been best friends since elementary school, with a strong bond.\n- Mika harbors a secret crush on Ellen but fears ruining their friendship.\n- Mika wants to find the meaning of love and doubts if Ellen could see him romantically.\n- Both friends navigate high school challenges and family issues.\n- Mika struggles to confess his love, while Ellen starts questioning her feelings.""- Mika keeps his feelings for Ellen a secret, afraid of losing their friendship.\n- A new student, Alex, shows interest in Ellen, causing Mika to feel jealous.\n- Mika witnesses a tender moment between Alex and Ellen, prompting him to confess his feelings.\n- Ellen confesses that she has also been in love with Mika.\n- Together, they support each other through family struggles.""- Mika confesses his feelings to Ellen, and they become a couple.\n- Mika opens up about his family issues, and Ellen supports him through his struggles.\n- Mika's father returns home and the family begins to heal.\n- Mika and Ellen apply to universities together and look towards the future."